nt pp. 55–65; PDF pp. 77–87"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.2–2.3, pp. 16–24; local typed letter/word transition interfaces"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> (nondeterministic finite automaton)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\">\\(\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)\\)</span> (extended transition, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91c5fa9978cd7fef\" href=\"?note=91c5fa9978cd7fef\" title=\"73-df-nfa-extended-transition\">73-df-nfa-extended-transition</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Accept}_M\">\\(\\operatorname{Accept}_M\\)</span> 是此词域上的谓词，扩张转移仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\times\\Sigma^*\">\\(Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 内调用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An input is accepted exactly when at least one reachable state is final.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-nfa-extended-transition","status":"resolved","id":"91c5fa9978cd7fef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-nfa-extended-transition","status":"resolved","id":"91c5fa9978cd7fef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)$ (extended transition, see [[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\widehat{\\delta}_M:Q\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\mathcal P(Q)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Accept}_M","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\times\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\leftrightarrow\nw\\in\\Sigma^*\\land\\widehat{\\delta}_M(q_0,w)\\cap F\\neq\\varnothing","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nfa\\text{-}accepted\\text{-}language}\\vdash\nL(M)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*:\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w)\\}","display":true}],"bytes":1705,"backlinks":[{"id":"52ddba8829989be5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\widehat{\\delta}_M$ 见 [[73-df-nfa-extended-transition]]，$L(M)$ 见 [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]；无下标的扩张转移只用于这个固定 $M$。"},{"id":"05d04ddcf190776e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\in\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$，其转移和语言见 [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]]。DFA 结构见 [[73-df-dfa-structure]]；$S\\subseteq Q,a\\in\\Sigma$。"},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-24","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-nfa-language-semantics|Language Accepted by an NFA]]"},{"id":"c045448153929107","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dca22faafaee72fb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma},\\mathsf{NFA}_{\\Sigma}$ and $L(\\cdot)$ (automata and accepted languages, see [[73-df-dfa-language-semantics]] and [[73-df-nfa-language-semantics]])"},{"id":"602df1b3cfe65cc9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["91c5fa9978cd7fef"]}